1
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,630
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,790
♪All worldly pursuits are fleeting
dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,350
♪Sorrow fades away, resentment fades
away♪

4
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,870
♪Anger and grudges are but passing
clouds♪

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:26,640
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:30,150
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,230
♪This humble monk wanders freely across
the land♪

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,430
♪Laughing and fooling around, yet bound
by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,950
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:47,110
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,230
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit of
wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,580
♪But in the end, all things simply pass
by♪

13
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,350
♪Better to follow the heart and find
true joy♪

14
00:00:57,640 --> 00:01:00,550
♪Don't let worldly troubles bind your
soul♪

15
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,190
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,870
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,430
♪With my worn-out fan in hand, I care
not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:08,750
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,510
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:13,910
♪Simple robes and straw sandals beat
fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,070
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,470
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:23,750
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:27,030
♪I cling not to appearances, finding
freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:29,070
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,540
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,150
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:39,630
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,990
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:45,750
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,870
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:52,990
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,780 --> 00:01:56,380
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 12=

34
00:01:57,860 --> 00:02:00,700
I am Sun Wukong, the Monkey King
of Shuilian Cave, Huaguo Mountain.

35
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:03,860
I'm the Great Sage Equaling Heaven!

36
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:08,580
I'll beat you all to a pulp!

37
00:02:14,340 --> 00:02:14,900
Li Jing!

38
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:16,060
Prepare to die!

39
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:19,860
I'll fight you to the death!

40
00:02:22,660 --> 00:02:23,420
Wow!

41
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,580
Now this is worth watching.

42
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:36,380
Whoa!

43
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:37,540
- Wow!
- Isn't that heavy?

44
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:38,460
Let me hold it for you.

45
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:38,940
Sure!

46
00:02:38,940 --> 00:02:39,820
Hey! No, you can't!

47
00:02:39,820 --> 00:02:40,740
No, no, no!

48
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:43,100
Can she hold it?

49
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:43,660
Can she?

50
00:02:43,660 --> 00:02:45,100
- Can she?
- Yes!

51
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:45,820
Hey, let go!

52
00:02:45,820 --> 00:02:46,500
- Let go!
- Fine!

53
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:46,900
Fine.

54
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:47,380
All good now?

55
00:02:47,380 --> 00:02:48,020
Yes!

56
00:02:48,020 --> 00:02:48,900
You're sure?

57
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:49,780
Yes! Let go!

58
00:02:49,780 --> 00:02:50,100
Ah!

59
00:02:50,740 --> 00:02:51,580
Wow!

60
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:52,980
- Tell me!
- Hey!

61
00:02:53,820 --> 00:02:54,620
Why

62
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:56,180
did you release that demon?

63
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:56,860
Well...

64
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:58,700
Didn't Biqing say

65
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:00,740
once you dealt with

66
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:01,780
the Three-Headed Jiao,

67
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:03,540
he'd return to Western Paradise?

68
00:03:03,540 --> 00:03:04,940
I couldn't bear to lose him.

69
00:03:04,940 --> 00:03:05,740
So I...

70
00:03:05,740 --> 00:03:07,020
I wanted to let it out,

71
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:08,220
then Biqing would stay.

72
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:09,540
That excuse

73
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:11,780
is way too mushy.

74
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:14,020
Oh, come on.

75
00:03:20,820 --> 00:03:21,500
Don't you know

76
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:23,060
you're a monk?

77
00:03:23,060 --> 00:03:23,660
I do.

78
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:25,620
Everything is destined.

79
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:26,820
Amitabha Buddha.

80
00:03:26,820 --> 00:03:27,940
I know.

81
00:03:28,140 --> 00:03:28,940
I'm telling you...

82
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:31,300
Hey, hey!

83
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:32,900
Sorry about that.

84
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:33,700
It's fine.

85
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:34,100
Keep going.

86
00:03:34,580 --> 00:03:40,180
Go! Go! Go!

87
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:51,900
Go! Go! Go!

88
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:52,420
And you!

89
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:54,180
You almost caused a disaster!

90
00:03:54,180 --> 00:03:54,980
I know, I know.

91
00:03:54,980 --> 00:03:56,620
Come back to Lingyin Temple first.

92
00:03:56,620 --> 00:03:57,140
Hey, hey!

93
00:03:57,900 --> 00:03:59,020
No. I'm not going back.

94
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:00,940
Biqing's gone from Lingyin Temple.

95
00:04:00,940 --> 00:04:02,500
There's no point in going back.

96
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:03,740
I've decided...

97
00:04:07,620 --> 00:04:08,140
Wow!

98
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:09,860
to wander the world

99
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:11,060
and seek adventure.

100
00:04:13,660 --> 00:04:17,180
- He's so cool!
- He's so cute!

101
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:17,780
Hey, hey!

102
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:18,660
Don't leave!

103
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:19,380
Go after him!

104
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:20,020
Right!

105
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:20,940
Seriously.

106
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:29,860
Hey, hey!

107
00:04:30,180 --> 00:04:30,940
What?

108
00:04:30,940 --> 00:04:32,580
That monkey's incredible.

109
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:33,940
Get lost!

110
00:04:35,660 --> 00:04:36,220
Whoa!

111
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:37,380
Thunder God!

112
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,580
That monkey's gone crazy.

113
00:04:38,580 --> 00:04:39,540
He's even attacking his own side.

114
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:40,420
Let's get out of here.

115
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:41,780
Let's go!

116
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:44,460
Master Guangliang,

117
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:46,540
how could I blame you?

118
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:48,500
Why was he so heartless?

119
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:50,180
He wouldn't even see me one last time.

120
00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:52,420
He cares about you too much.

121
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:53,140
That's why

122
00:04:53,140 --> 00:04:55,220
he couldn't bear to face you.

123
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:57,740
Amitabha Buddha.

124
00:04:57,740 --> 00:04:59,860
You two have truly moved me.

125
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:00,780
With Buddha as my witness,

126
00:05:00,780 --> 00:05:02,540
you'll meet again someday.

127
00:05:02,540 --> 00:05:03,180
Mm.

128
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:09,260
Master.

129
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:11,460
All right.

130
00:05:11,460 --> 00:05:12,060
You're done here.

131
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:12,740
Come here. Hug me.

132
00:05:12,780 --> 00:05:13,380
Come on, hug me.

133
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:14,860
I meant Master Guangliang,

134
00:05:14,860 --> 00:05:15,660
not you.

135
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:17,780
Quit dragging this out.

136
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:18,580
Get going.

137
00:05:21,820 --> 00:05:24,660
Amitabha Buddha.

138
00:05:27,900 --> 00:05:28,780
Oh...

139
00:05:35,420 --> 00:05:36,380
Goodbye, everyone.

140
00:05:37,900 --> 00:05:38,420
Goodbye,

141
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:40,860
Master Guangliang.

142
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:44,060
Goodbye!

143
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:49,580
Hey...

144
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:51,700
Hey.

145
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:53,500
What's he doing there?

146
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:54,340
Master!

147
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:56,140
Master!

148
00:05:57,980 --> 00:05:59,820
I'll miss you too, Master!

149
00:06:00,980 --> 00:06:02,500
Goodbye, Master!

150
00:06:17,220 --> 00:06:18,460
Biqing!

151
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:19,940
I'm sorry.

152
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:21,860
I really can't bear to lose you!

153
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:23,220
Biqing!

154
00:06:23,220 --> 00:06:24,860
(Mahavira Hall)
Biqing!

155
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:25,780
Bi...

156
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:28,080
Ow!

157
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:33,420
From now on, the Linglong Pagoda

158
00:06:33,420 --> 00:06:34,380
will stay right here.

159
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:37,100
Let's see who dares mess with it again.

160
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:37,460
I...

161
00:06:37,780 --> 00:06:38,060
Uh...

162
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:39,100
I think...

163
00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:40,380
- You think?
- Mm.

164
00:06:40,620 --> 00:06:41,860
The Linglong Pagoda's password

165
00:06:41,860 --> 00:06:43,540
is known to that demon now.

166
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:45,060
- Right.
- Let's change it, then.

167
00:06:45,060 --> 00:06:46,540
Guangliang is the most handsome.

168
00:06:46,540 --> 00:06:47,820
Everyone agree?

169
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:52,300
Say yes!

170
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:53,100
In your dreams.

171
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:54,260
That chubby face?

172
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:55,980
How is that handsome?

173
00:06:55,980 --> 00:06:56,500
Ugh.

174
00:06:56,660 --> 00:06:57,220
Exactly.

175
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:59,420
How about changing it to

176
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:00,860
Celestial maiden Piaopiao,

177
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:02,500
fairest in the Three Realms!

178
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:05,980
You dream even bigger than he does.

179
00:07:05,980 --> 00:07:06,820
Seriously.

180
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:07,940
Actually,

181
00:07:07,940 --> 00:07:09,340
I've already picked the password.

182
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:12,660
That look on your face...

183
00:07:12,660 --> 00:07:13,420
Let me guess.

184
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:15,660
Is the password "Dragon-Subduing Arhat

185
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:17,140
is the most handsome in the world"?

186
00:07:17,420 --> 00:07:18,460
When it comes to spiritual power,

187
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:20,420
- you're a little stronger than me.
- Huh?

188
00:07:20,420 --> 00:07:21,460
But when it comes to looks,

189
00:07:21,460 --> 00:07:23,220
I'm miles ahead of you.

190
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:24,380
Stop guessing.

191
00:07:24,380 --> 00:07:25,140
Actually,

192
00:07:25,620 --> 00:07:27,180
I already changed the password.

193
00:07:28,060 --> 00:07:28,460
Look.

194
00:07:29,580 --> 00:07:32,540
New Lingyin Temple team is the best!

195
00:07:35,540 --> 00:07:36,380
Not bad.

196
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:37,180
I agree.

197
00:07:37,340 --> 00:07:38,060
I approve.

198
00:07:38,780 --> 00:07:39,740
Wow!

199
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:43,260
Oh my goodness.

200
00:07:45,460 --> 00:07:46,060
No choice.

201
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:47,940
I'll have to speed up your growth.

202
00:07:49,660 --> 00:07:50,380
Little one,

203
00:07:50,700 --> 00:07:51,380
grow up quickly

204
00:07:51,660 --> 00:07:53,900
and find a love of your own.

205
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:54,860
Here.

206
00:07:55,260 --> 00:07:55,980
Open wide.

207
00:07:56,180 --> 00:07:57,340
Ah.

208
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:00,860
Hey!

209
00:08:01,420 --> 00:08:02,220
Who are you?

210
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:03,820
I...

211
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:06,900
I saw how poor your family is

212
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:08,340
and feared the baby was malnourished.

213
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:09,060
So,

214
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:10,540
I brought the baby some supplements.

215
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:12,060
Supplements?

216
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:16,900
You're a saint!

217
00:08:17,780 --> 00:08:19,220
Life just isn't fair.

218
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:20,380
They're both named Ke Ayao.

219
00:08:20,540 --> 00:08:22,420
The other one was born rich.

220
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:24,260
But my baby

221
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:26,180
can't even get enough milk.

222
00:08:26,580 --> 00:08:27,460
You mean

223
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:28,580
there's another Ke Ayao?

224
00:08:29,260 --> 00:08:29,700
Yes.

225
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:31,644
The famous Mr. Ke of Lin'an City

226
00:08:31,645 --> 00:08:32,820
has a daughter

227
00:08:32,820 --> 00:08:33,860
named Ke Ayao too.

228
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:35,420
She's eighteen,

229
00:08:35,420 --> 00:08:37,980
frail and sickly,

230
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:39,460
and a hopeless romantic.

231
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:40,300
Today,

232
00:08:40,540 --> 00:08:41,900
she's getting married.

233
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:46,500
Thank you.

234
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:49,940
She...

235
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:52,460
She really is a saint!

236
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:01,140
(So she's the Ke Ayao I'm looking for.)

237
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:03,260
(She's so young.)

238
00:09:03,740 --> 00:09:05,060
(And she's really beautiful.)

239
00:09:05,460 --> 00:09:07,740
(If not for my benefactor
and the fox clan,)

240
00:09:08,140 --> 00:09:09,940
(I couldn't bring myself to do this.)

241
00:09:10,860 --> 00:09:11,820
What are you thinking about?

242
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:14,820
Nothing, Miss.

243
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:15,820
You're new here, aren't you?

244
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:17,260
I don't recognize you.

245
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:19,460
I'm here to do your hair and makeup.

246
00:09:19,740 --> 00:09:21,580
I'll make sure you look beautiful
for your wedding.

247
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:24,780
But

248
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:25,660
Miss,

249
00:09:26,060 --> 00:09:27,020
before you get married,

250
00:09:27,020 --> 00:09:28,660
do you have any unfulfilled wishes?

251
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:30,980
I'm marrying Shen Lang today.

252
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:32,580
I couldn't ask for anything more.

253
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:34,140
Even if I died now,

254
00:09:34,980 --> 00:09:36,140
I'd have no regrets.

255
00:09:36,540 --> 00:09:37,500
Oh.

256
00:09:37,860 --> 00:09:39,420
You said it yourself.

257
00:09:39,660 --> 00:09:40,180
What?

258
00:09:42,060 --> 00:09:42,860
Nothing.

259
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:46,300
Is there someone you love?

260
00:09:46,820 --> 00:09:47,900
I do.

261
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:48,900
But

262
00:09:49,060 --> 00:09:51,020
he's in prison right now.

263
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:53,220
So I've been traveling everywhere,

264
00:09:53,740 --> 00:09:55,940
trying to get him out as soon as I can.

265
00:09:56,900 --> 00:09:58,420
If there's anything I can do,

266
00:09:58,420 --> 00:09:59,980
just say the word.

267
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,020
Oh.

268
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:02,860
You said that yourself too.

269
00:10:06,780 --> 00:10:08,220
It's nothing.

270
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:11,060
So what's the man you love

271
00:10:11,060 --> 00:10:12,500
like?

272
00:10:12,980 --> 00:10:13,900
Him?

273
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:16,060
He's a little goofy and clumsy,

274
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:17,180
but

275
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:18,780
he has a kind heart.

276
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:20,060
To me,

277
00:10:20,260 --> 00:10:22,180
he's my hero.

278
00:10:23,740 --> 00:10:24,700
Everyone says

279
00:10:24,700 --> 00:10:25,660
I'm a fool for love.

280
00:10:25,940 --> 00:10:26,540
But today,

281
00:10:26,540 --> 00:10:27,620
I've finally met

282
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:29,220
someone even more lovesick than me.

283
00:10:30,460 --> 00:10:31,300
Ah!

284
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:34,060
You...

285
00:10:34,300 --> 00:10:35,020
What's wrong?

286
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:35,460
I...

287
00:10:35,460 --> 00:10:36,380
My stomach hurts.

288
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:37,340
I need the bathroom.

289
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:40,820
What...

290
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:49,340
Am I a sucker for pretty faces too?

291
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:51,860
I almost blew the whole plan.

292
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:57,340
I only agreed to this marriage

293
00:10:57,540 --> 00:10:58,740
because I love my daughter.

294
00:10:59,060 --> 00:11:00,980
If you plan to live off my daughter,

295
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:02,380
forget it.

296
00:11:05,060 --> 00:11:05,540
What's that?

297
00:11:05,980 --> 00:11:06,940
Do you want to throw that at me?

298
00:11:07,780 --> 00:11:08,580
You misunderstand, Mr. Ke.

299
00:11:09,660 --> 00:11:10,380
I, Shen Lang,

300
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:11,940
would never marry for money.

301
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:13,740
My love for Ayao is true.

302
00:11:14,220 --> 00:11:15,100
Heaven itself is my witness.

303
00:11:16,740 --> 00:11:17,020
Hmph.

304
00:11:17,300 --> 00:11:18,140
Save it.

305
00:11:18,540 --> 00:11:19,900
Your love letters may fool Ayao,

306
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:20,820
but they won't fool me.

307
00:11:21,100 --> 00:11:22,460
Ayao told me

308
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:24,460
your Rouge Snow,

309
00:11:24,461 --> 00:11:25,660
made with the finest pearls,

310
00:11:25,660 --> 00:11:26,620
is second to none

311
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:27,860
and sells extremely well.

312
00:11:27,980 --> 00:11:29,300
But fine pearls

313
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:30,460
have been hard to find lately.

314
00:11:31,140 --> 00:11:33,620
I hear you've run out of Rouge Snow.

315
00:11:34,700 --> 00:11:35,460
Yes.

316
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,100
So what?

317
00:11:37,580 --> 00:11:39,980
My father studied Rouge Snow too.

318
00:11:40,660 --> 00:11:42,620
He found a common medicinal herb

319
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:43,860
that could replace the pearls.

320
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:45,380
And this

321
00:11:45,780 --> 00:11:47,460
is the Rouge Snow my father made.

322
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:49,260
Oh?

323
00:11:57,940 --> 00:11:59,580
It's exactly the same as

324
00:11:59,580 --> 00:12:00,260
my family's Rouge Snow.

325
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:01,500
What herb

326
00:12:02,300 --> 00:12:03,580
did he use?

327
00:12:03,940 --> 00:12:04,780
That's

328
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,660
the secret formula my father left me.

329
00:12:13,340 --> 00:12:14,580
(Secret Formula)

330
00:12:14,860 --> 00:12:15,300
Oh!

331
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:16,660
This is wonderful!

332
00:12:17,140 --> 00:12:18,940
If this saves the Ke family's name,

333
00:12:19,260 --> 00:12:19,740
then

334
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:21,780
you'll inherit my estate.

335
00:12:25,780 --> 00:12:26,860
Rouge Snow...

336
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:29,780
I sense murderous intent.

337
00:12:31,540 --> 00:12:32,140
Sir!

338
00:12:32,940 --> 00:12:33,540
Sir!

339
00:12:33,660 --> 00:12:34,820
Something terrible happened!

340
00:12:39,980 --> 00:12:43,030
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

341
00:12:43,380 --> 00:12:46,230
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

342
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:50,030
♪Everything I own is worn and
weathered♪

343
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:53,110
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

344
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:56,870
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

345
00:12:56,920 --> 00:13:00,280
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

346
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:03,830
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

347
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:13,750
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

348
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:16,990
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

349
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:20,310
♪After the wedding, I became an
immortal♪

350
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,990
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

351
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,910
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

352
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,470
♪I left my wife behind♪

353
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:27,070
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

354
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:30,910
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

355
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:32,030
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

356
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:34,150
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

357
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:35,830
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

358
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,710
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

359
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:41,070
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

360
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:44,350
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

361
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:47,470
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

362
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:50,830
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

363
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:54,510
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

364
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:57,870
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

365
00:13:57,880 --> 00:14:00,950
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

366
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:04,590
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

367
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:08,030
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

368
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:11,590
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

369
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:15,070
♪You're just wasting your time♪

370
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:18,030
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

371
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:19,710
♪And I just laugh happily♪

372
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:23,110
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

373
